sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title ChalkTalk collaborative editing flow

    participant Editor as Editor / Yjs client
    participant Hocuspocus as Hocuspocus server
    participant Database as PostgreSQL

    Editor->>Hocuspocus: Connect with one-use ticket
    Hocuspocus->>Database: Fetch Yjs state
    Hocuspocus-->>Editor: Synchronize missing updates
    Editor->>Editor: Apply edit to Y.Text content
    Editor->>Hocuspocus: Send Yjs update
    Hocuspocus->>Hocuspocus: Merge update into shared Y.Doc
    Hocuspocus->>Database: Upload document state
